    "created_at": "2025-05-02T11:21:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-02T11:21:40Z",
    "body": "For Firefox we only changed the behavior (blank page, url bar updated) for cross origin sites to avoid spoofing. Demo: https://eviltrap.site/trap/http-auth-prompt-spoof/. For same-origin that's not really a concern.\r\n\r\nI'm in favor of aligning with Chrome and inserting a blank interstitial for both cross and same origin cases to make the behavior more consistent.",
